/**
 * SpotterAI — exercise safety & substitution metadata (data only, no logic)
 * ============================================================================
 * The rich half of the canonical catalog: muscles worked, movement pattern,
 * joint stress, injury contraindications, and substitution / regression /
 * progression options.
 *
 * This file is DATA ONLY so that `exercise-catalog.js` can merge it with the
 * searchable base list without a circular import. Matching, aliasing, and
 * lookup all live in the catalog; nothing here knows how a name is resolved.
 *
 * Contraindication / jointStress keys match the evaluator's injury keys:
 *   "knee" | "lower_back" | "shoulder" | "wrist".
 *
 * `equipment` here is an array of fine-grained lowercase TAGS (used by the
 * equipment-fit check). The user-facing single-word equipment label lives on
 * the base list in exercise-catalog.js.
 */

