  // CONTRAINDICATIONS WERE NOT taken as drafted. They drive the injury warnings,
  // and checked against an already-curated twin the drafts disagreed 19 times
  // out of 28 — a dead hang contraindicated for shoulders while a pull-up was
  // not, all four cable-fly variants flagged while Cable Fly was not, "Standing
  // Overhead Press" flagged for lower back where "Overhead Press", the same
  // lift, says shoulder. An incoherent warning set is worse than a conservative
  // one, so where a curated twin exists the twin wins. That pass moved 19
  // entries and brought the flag rate to 27%, against 29% in the hand-written
  // data above.
